{% twoColumns reverseOnMobile=true %}
## Rebekah Miller - Office Administrator

Rebekah grew up attending summer camp and has a continued passion for reaching youth and young adults through camping ministry. During her college years, Rebekah's passion for camping ministry grew as she took on the role of cabin counselor. She graduated from Bethel University in 2017 with her B.A. in Elementary Education. Rebekah’s experience in youth ministry led her to work in education before she and her husband, Connor moved to Otyokwah in 2020 as part of the full time leadership team. Her greatest desire is for people to know Christ and mature in their faith, and she finds great joy in walking with and mentoring them on this journey.

