{% twoColumns reverseOnMobile=true %}
## Evan Fairrow- Discipleship Director

Evan has been involved with Camp Otyokwah for six years. After serving as a camp counselor for, he joined full-time staff as Program Director in 2023, helping lead and coordinate summer programming alongside the resident staff team. He now serves as Camp Otyokwah’s Discipleship Director, focusing on creating meaningful opportunities for spiritual growth and helping cultivate a culture centered on knowing and following Christ. Evan graduated from Miami University with a B.A. in Psychology and a minor in Childhood Studies before earning his M.A. in Clinical Mental Health Counseling from The Ohio State University. He is a Licensed Professional Counselor and seeks to thoughtfully combine biblical truth, relational ministry, and applicable clinical skills to better understand and serve young people.

